;; f_1F85()
;;  Description:
;;   Handle changes in controller IO Input bits, update ship movement.
;;   (Called continuously in game-play, but also toward end of demo starting
;;   when the two ships are joined.)
;; IN:
;;  ...
;; OUT:
;;  ...
